Subject: [OS-12 / HW-03] Keep CSIPHY/VFE consistent with Nabu driver interfaces

GPL-2.0-only, upstream notices retained. CSIPHY register implementation from
Kumar-Jy/linux 72ec20d0e5c3566790ec809749a4ce642439d37c matches this fork's
header/resource types; the partially imported 7.4 implementation requires
absent regs/init interfaces and SoC enums. Keep the known SM8150 sequence.
Use array indices for legacy PHY IDs and existing vfe_get_output allocator.
Mainline kernel baseline stays 7.4-rc3; camera validation remains pending.

